{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solateria is a 2D action Metroidvania game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze enemy patterns and execute precise parries as you venture through the world of Solateria with stylish fire-based action that burns everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/\uc5f0\uc18d_\ud328\ub9c1_gif.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a small fire-element &quot;Litt,&quot; born into a world of Litt that has fallen to the Shadow Plague.<br>You awaken to the desperate voice of someone urging you to find the &quot;Primordial Flame&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embarking on a journey, you seek the\u00a0Primordial Flame the only hope to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who was the owner of that voice? Why has the world fallen into ruin? Perhaps the answers lie at the end of your quest, where the Primordial Flame awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heat System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a fire-element Pyron warrior, you can gather Heat through parries and Pyron Actions to unleash significantly more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in relentless combat and maintain your Heat level to enjoy non-stop, aggressive battles! Wherever you pass, everything will burn, leaving nothing behind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/Heat_System.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Burn Everything!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the fire-element abilities of Pyron to burn creatures to ashes and defeat powerful bosses. Set objects in the field ablaze to uncover hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/Burn.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parrying Fun and &quot;Pyron Actions&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn enemy patterns and parry at the right moment. Successfully parry specific patterns to trigger one of several &quot;Pyron Actions&quot; and gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/\ub3d9\uc2dc_\ud328\ub9c1.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Dark World of the &quot;Litt&quot;</strong> <br>Pyron, Ophilin, Zephiron, Mucora, and Terradin. In Solateria, the home of these five Litt tribes, the Shadow Plague has brought devastation. Embark on an adventure in a world of Litt that appears beautiful but harbors dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/2_Jima.gif?t=1745201859\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Drawn Map</strong> <br>Explore a vast world crafted with hand-drawn graphics. Discover hidden secrets, create shortcuts, and delve deeper into Solateria as you uncover the truth of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/1.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947280?t=1745201859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/1eef52a955af9f79616f0feabfe4a3cc38dc4345/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745201859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it