ph\">Engage in relentless combat and maintain your Heat level to enjoy non-stop, aggressive battles! Wherever you pass, everything will burn, leaving nothing behind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/Heat_System.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Burn Everything!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the fire-element abilities of Pyron to burn creatures to ashes and defeat powerful bosses. Set objects in the field ablaze to uncover hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/Burn.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parrying Fun and &quot;Pyron Actions&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn enemy patterns and parry at the right moment. Successfully parry specific patterns to trigger one of several &quot;Pyron Actions&quot; and gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/\ub3d9\uc2dc_\ud328\ub9c1.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Dark World of the &quot;Litt&quot;</strong> <br>Pyron, Ophilin, Zephiron, Mucora, and Terradin. In Solateria, the home of these five Litt tribes, the Shadow Plague has brought devastation. Embark on an adventure in a world of Litt that appears beautiful but harbors dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/2_Jima.gif?t=1745201859\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Drawn Map</strong> <br>Explore a vast world crafted with hand-drawn graphics. Discover hidden secrets, create shortcuts, and delve deeper into Solateria as you uncover the truth of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/extras/1.gif?t=1745201859\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Studio Doodal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/358247f5361a982d960803e41db4f6265fcfbb9c/header.jpg?t=1745201859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118589,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118589/movie480.mp4?t=1742961720","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118589/movie_max.mp4?t=1742961720"},"name":"solateria","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118589/25d138b188bf2a2c97d90f121cc162568ce6c997/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742961720","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118589/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742961720","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118589/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742961720"}}],"name":"Solateria","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DirectX 9.1+ or OpenGL 3.2+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>