a379a858b5ef8720f4f7e2dd54ec5b97254.600x338.jpg?t=1745201859"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/131df4f33201bce09bbab279199ddb185e47f1c4/ss_131df4f33201bce09bbab279199ddb185e47f1c4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745201859","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/131df4f33201bce09bbab279199ddb185e47f1c4/ss_131df4f33201bce09bbab279199ddb185e47f1c4.600x338.jpg?t=1745201859"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/4bb4cd6a6ddb02fa38c9adbd3b196e3f834ee20a/ss_4bb4cd6a6ddb02fa38c9adbd3b196e3f834ee20a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745201859","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947280/4bb4cd6a6ddb02fa38c9adbd3b196e3f834ee20a/ss_4bb4cd6a6ddb02fa38c9adbd3b196e3f834ee20a.600x338.jpg?t=1745201859"}],"short_description":"Solateria is a hand-drawn, parry-based action metroidvania game. Join a small flame-born warrior on a stylish combat journey to find the Primordial Flame, the last hope for a world consumed by plague. Burn everything, explore the unknown, and draw closer to the secrets of the world.","steam_appid":2947280,"support_info":{"email":"contact@studiodoodal.com","url":"https://discord.gg/tqqMPrbZWH"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}